    "title": "Immediate Requirement Logistics Manager at DTDC International Enterprises",
    "description": "Are you a skilled Logistics Manager looking for your next big career move? DTDC International Enterprises in Jodhpur offers you the perfect platform to grow professionally and personally.\n\nAbout DTDC International Enterprises:\nDTDC International Enterprises is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Oversee end-to-end logistics operations for timely delivery\n• Ensure proper handling, packaging, and labeling of goods\n• Manage a fleet of vehicles and coordinate with drivers\n• Handle customs clearance for import and export shipments\n• Manage reverse logistics and return merchandise authorization\n• Optimize delivery routes to reduce cost and improve efficiency\n• Conduct periodic vendor audits and evaluate logistics partners\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Arch / M.Arch from recognized institution\n• 6-10 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Cold Chain Logistics\n• Proficiency in INCOTERMS\n• Proficiency in WMS\n• Proficiency in Vendor Management\n• Proficiency in GPS Tracking Systems\n• Proficiency in Customs Clearance\n• Proficiency in Freight Forwarding\n• Proficiency in Last Mile Delivery\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• Professional development and training programs\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Recognition and rewards programs\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Salary Range: 12 LPA - 25 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Jodhpur, Rajasthan, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with DTDC International Enterprises!",
